# === Third-party dependencies (will be managed by submodule or vcpkg) ===
# third_party/ directories are tracked individually

# docs/ is ignored by default so ad-hoc reports stay local; every maintained
# doc is listed here explicitly (curated 2026-11-03, code is the source of truth).
docs/*
!docs/源码对照迁移任务追踪.md
!docs/架构说明.md
!docs/上游基线与功能矩阵.md
!docs/services-status.md
!docs/依赖与协议边界审计.md
!docs/ai-control.md
!docs/LAN打印机接入.md
!docs/创想云模型库接入.md
!docs/qt612-upgrade-notes.md
!docs/perf-baseline.md
# perf/waves archive: same-machine A/B report + wave design + UI compare
!docs/perf-ab-report.md
!docs/perf-wave2b-design.md
!docs/ui-compare-report.md
# gate allowlists (qmllint ratchet, style-literal ratchet) are build inputs
!docs/qmllint-baseline/
!docs/qmllint-baseline/*
!docs/style-baseline/
!docs/style-baseline/*
# UI reference material consumed by scripts/ui_diff_*.{py,ps1}
!docs/ui-reference/
!docs/ui-reference/*
!docs/visual-compare/
!docs/visual-compare/*
docs/visual-compare/*.png

